  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Section for Turkish-Swedish Cooperation. The Consulate focuses on areas related to the political, economic and social development in Turkey and endeavors to contribute to mutual understanding in the fields of tradition, culture and religion. An additional task is to attend to questions pertaining to the Eastern Mediterranean, South-eastern Europe, the Caucasus and Central Asia.</narrative>
